# Buttondown API key for the rate-alert email capture (app/api/subscribe).
# https://docs.buttondown.com/api-subscribers-create
# Get it from your Buttondown account settings; set it as a Vercel project
# env var for Production/Preview. Never commit the real value.
BUTTONDOWN_API_KEY=

# Amplitude Browser SDK API key for behavioral/funnel tracking (Corridor
# Viewed, Rate Alert Signup Started/Completed/Failed). Public by design —
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ vars ship to the client — but still don't commit your real
# value here. Leave unset to disable Amplitude entirely (Plausible
# pageviews keep working either way).
NEXT_PUBLIC_AMPLITUDE_API_KEY=
